OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban to continue
OL,4,Athroughout autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Tucker, Thames Water's demand
OL,7,Freduction manager, urged customers to
OL,8,Fmake "small changes", such as taking
OL,9,Fshorter showers and turning off taps.
